as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"Rks6786","datePublished":"2026-08-25","name":"My everyday commute companion","reviewBody":"After trying multiple other podcasts to keep up with AI developments, I have settled on this one. Its one of the best podcasts to be aware of latest AI news and talks.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"Big bank hater","datePublished":"2026-08-16","name":"EXACTLY what I was looking for","reviewBody":"Dear Nathaniel, great job. Don’t stop. I love the content. You cover a broad range of topics in AI so it caters to everyone. What I would love to see more: more specific tips for coding.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"Jdsas37","datePublished":"2026-08-04","name":"Essential AI podcast","reviewBody":"I have referred multiple people to this podcast. They become regulars like me. \n\nEntertaining, insightful, and useful - especially his various free training programs. Essential in keeping up in these fast-changing times.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"Jphpjp","datePublished":"2026-07-27","name":"Uncompromising and phenomenal","reviewBody":"I’m an AI professional and this is my single podcast. I listen to every single day.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"NJF_2026","datePublished":"2026-07-27","name":"The Entire Spectrum","reviewBody":"I can’t recommend this podcast enough for people interested in learning how to use AI and the effects this technology is having on the US economy and our daily lives. That’s where NLW deserves the most credit - episodes are more than just useful, insightful, and current - they cover a broad range of high level topics and detailed AI/agentic how-to guides. Therefore this is the only podcast you need to become an expert on using AI and also see the big picture of its impact.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}},{"@type":"Review","author":"MarKat1990","datePublished":"2026-07-24","name":"Essential information every day","reviewBody":"I haven’t missed an episode in 18 months!This podcast is my top recommendation for understanding AI and how our work, lives, and world is being transformed. (for the good).   Thanks NLW! Keep it up.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"CreativeWorkSeries","name":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","description":"A daily news analysis show on all things artificial intelligence. NLW looks at AI from multiple angles, from the explosion of creativity brought on by new tools like Midjourney and ChatGPT to the potential disruptions to work and industries as we know them to the great philosophical, ethical and practical questions of advanced general intelligence, alignment and x-risk.","genre":["Technology","Podcasts"],"url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-ai-daily-brief-artificial-intelligence-news/id1680633614","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"dateModified":"2026-09-13T11:33:00Z","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","caption":"The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis","width":3000,"height":3000},"thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"}}],"workExample":[{"@type":"AudioObject","datePublished":"2026-09-13","description":"AI can help you work faster, but it can also expand what you’re capable of doing in the first place. NLW explores ten ways to think bigger with “opportunity AI,” from building video production pipelines and interactive client proposals to turning","duration":"PT28M1S","genre":["Technology"],"name":"10 Ways to Think Bigger with Opportunity AI","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"requiresSubscription":"no","uploadDate":"2026-09-13","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/10-ways-to-think-bigger-with-opportunity-ai/id1680633614?i=1000789330156","thumbnailUrl":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/9c/78/d8/9c78d82d-a2d1-a026-6ca2-f92ea61be9ae/mza_18421328158594577747.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp"},{"@type":"AudioObject","datePublished":"2026-09-11","description":"GPT‑Live 1 opens up a much wider range of real-time voice and vision applications, from customer service and sales to education, healthcare, and hands-free work. NLW breaks down who should be using the latest AI tools and the specific jobs each one is","duration":"PT31M40S","genre":["Technology"],"name":"What to Use the Latest AI Tools For","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0}],"requiresSubscription":"no","uploadDate":"2026-09-11","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/what-to-use-the-latest-ai-tools-for/id1680633614?i=1000789087942