></div></div></a> </div> </li><li class="svelte-834w84"><div class="episode svelte-h8r70z"> <a data-testid="click-action" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/why-gpt-6-astra-is-so-significant-and-so-confounding/id1680633614?i=1000788555819" class="link-action svelte-1c9ml6j"> <div data-testid="episode-wrapper" class="episode-wrapper svelte-h8r70z uses-wide-layout      has-artwork-end"> <div class="episode-details-container svelte-h8r70z"><section class="episode-details-container svelte-1dhn1xs episode-details-container--wide-layout" data-testid="episode-content"><div class="episode-details svelte-1dhn1xs"><div class="episode-details__eyebrow svelte-1dhn1xs"> <p class="episode-details__published-date svelte-1dhn1xs" data-testid="episode-details__published-date"><span class="eyebrow-text svelte-gq4kiu">  5d ago </span></p> </div> <div class="episode-details__title svelte-1dhn1xs"> <h3 class="episode-details__title-wrapper svelte-1dhn1xs" dir="auto"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353 multiline-clamp--overflow" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 3);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="episode-details__title-text" data-testid="episode-lockup-title">Why GPT-6 Astra Is So Significant and So Confounding</span></span> </div></h3></div> <div class="episode-details__summary svelte-1dhn1xs" data-testid="episode-content__summary"><p dir="auto"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353 multiline-clamp--overflow" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->GPT-6 Astra has produced spectacular 3D worlds, autonomous computer use and eye-popping demonstrations—but surprisingly mixed reactions from everyday users. NLW explains why Astra is so difficult to evaluate, what its unusual strengths reveal about OpenAI’s strategy, and why it may represent something bigger than a better model: a fundamental expansion of 