4w84"><div class="episode svelte-h8r70z"> <a data-testid="click-action" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-to-build-an-ai-native-company-today/id1680633614?i=1000788131301" class="link-action svelte-1c9ml6j"> <div data-testid="episode-wrapper" class="episode-wrapper svelte-h8r70z uses-wide-layout      has-artwork-end"> <div class="episode-details-container svelte-h8r70z"><section class="episode-details-container svelte-1dhn1xs episode-details-container--wide-layout" data-testid="episode-content"><div class="episode-details svelte-1dhn1xs"><div class="episode-details__eyebrow svelte-1dhn1xs"> <p class="episode-details__published-date svelte-1dhn1xs" data-testid="episode-details__published-date"><span class="eyebrow-text svelte-gq4kiu">  Sep 6 </span></p> </div> <div class="episode-details__title svelte-1dhn1xs"> <h3 class="episode-details__title-wrapper svelte-1dhn1xs" dir="auto"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353 multiline-clamp--overflow" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 3);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="episode-details__title-text" data-testid="episode-lockup-title">How to Build an AI-Native Company Today</span></span> </div></h3></div> <div class="episode-details__summary svelte-1dhn1xs" data-testid="episode-content__summary"><p dir="auto"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353 multiline-clamp--overflow" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->What does it actually take to build an AI-native company? NLW breaks down one AI leader's 30 features of AI-native organizations, from shared context and agent skills to self-improving workflows, token efficiency, and making every employee a builder. The episode explores how companies can redesign work around agents, where human judgment belongs, and why ownership and accountability are becoming essential parts of a new management 