Data centers could be placed where they won’t compete with us for water and electricity.  

They should be far from cities so they don’t create noise or air pollution near neighborhoods.

Why can’t these data centers be placed out in the middle of nowhere?<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div>  </div></div> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-ranejh" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-1" data-index="1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-ranejh"><div slot="item"> <div class="review svelte-lmsoqu" aria-labelledby="review-14541351071-title" role="comment" data-testid="amp-review__review"><div class="header svelte-lmsoqu"><div class="header-primary svelte-lmsoqu"><h3 id="review-14541351071-title" class="title svelte-lmsoqu" data-testid="amp-review__title" dir="auto">Add Video Support for Apple Podcasts!</h3>  <div class="stars svelte-lmsoqu" aria-label="3 Stars" data-testid="amp-review__rating-stars"><span data-testid="star-filled" class="star svelte-lmsoqu"><svg class="star-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg></span><span data-testid="star-filled" class="star svelte-lmsoqu"><svg class="star-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg></span><span data-testid=