2T10:11:22Z","title":"Data center locations","contents":"Can data centers be placed far away from neighborhoods?  Build them in unpopulated areas. \n\nData centers could be placed where they won’t compete with us for water and electricity.  \n\nThey should be far from cities so they don’t create noise or air pollution near neighborhoods.\n\nWhy can’t these data centers be placed out in the middle of nowhere?","rating":5,"reviewerName":"BGDem","moreAction":{"page":"reviews","pageData":{"headerButtonItems":[],"isExplicit":false,"isIncomplete":false,"presentationOptions":[],"shelves":[{"contentType":"reviews","$kind":"LegacyShelf","id":"ReviewsShelf","displaySubtitleAsEyebrow":false,"hideFromCarPlay":false,"isHorizontal":false,"items":[{"id":"14501189216","date":"2026-09-02T10:11:22Z","title":"Data center locations","contents":"Can data centers be placed far away from neighborhoods?  Build them in unpopulated areas. \n\nData centers could be placed where they won’t compete with us for water and electricity.  \n\nThey should be far from cities so they don’t create noise or air pollution near neighborhoods.\n\nWhy can’t these data centers be placed out in the middle of nowhere?","rating":5,"reviewerName":"BGDem","moreAction":null,"$kind":"Review"}],"mergeWhenFetched":false}],"pageMetrics":{"instructions":[],"pageFields":{},"custom":{}},"$kind":"StandardPage","title":"Ratings & Reviews"},"animationBehavior":"infer","destinationPageHeader":"standard","origin":"inapp","presentationContext":"infer","$kind":"LegacyFlowAction","actionMetrics":{"data":[],"custom":{}},"presentationStyle":["textFollowsTintColor","hasDisclosureIndicatorCompactOnly"]},"$kind":"Review"},{"id":"14541351071","date":"2026-09-12T15:00:33Z","title":"Add Video Support for Apple Podcasts!","contents":"This podcast is great, however the host mentions a lot of visual content. The video format is only available on YouTube and Spotify. Why not add support for Apple Podcasts?","rating":3,"reviewerName":"Avid Aviator","moreAction":{"page":"reviews","pageData":{"headerButtonItems":[],"isExplicit":false,"isIncomplete":false,"presentationOptions":[],"shelves":[{"contentType":"reviews","$kind":"LegacyShelf","id":"ReviewsShelf","displaySubtitleAsEyebrow":false,"hideFromCarPlay":false,"isHorizontal":false,"items":[{"id":"14541351071","date":"2026-09-12T15:00:33Z","title":"Add Video Support for Apple Podcasts!","contents":"This podcast is great, however the host mentions a lot of visual content. The video format is only available on YouTube and Spotify. Why not add support for Apple Podcasts?","rating":3,"reviewerName":"Avid Aviator","moreAction":null,"$kind":"Review"}],"mergeWhenFetched":false}],"pageMetrics":{"instructions":[],"pageFields":{},"custom":{}},"$kind":"StandardPage","title":"Ratings & Reviews"},"animationBehavior":"infer","destinationPageHeader":"standard","origin":"inapp","presentationContext":"infer","$kind":"LegacyFlowAction","actionMetrics":{"data":[],"custom":{}},"presentationStyle":["textFollowsTintColor","hasDisclosureIndicatorCompactOnly"]},"$kind":"Review"},{"id":"14535638219","date":"2026-09-11T04:10:04Z","title":"For the AI Sycophants","contents":"A good source of AI headlines, but look elsewhere for a truly balance analysis of current events. Nathanial almost always errs on the side of hype.","rating":4,"reviewerName":"ecksley","moreAction":{"page":"reviews","pageData":{"headerButtonItems":[],"isExplicit":false,"isIncomplete":false,"presentationOptions":[],"shelves":[{"contentType":"reviews","$kind":"LegacyShelf","id":"ReviewsShelf","displaySubtitleAsEyebrow":false,"hideFromCarPlay":false,"isHorizontal":false,"items":[{"id":"14535638219","date":"2026-09-11T04:10:04Z","title":"For the AI Sycophants","contents":"A good source of AI headlines, but look elsewhere for a truly balance analysis of current events. Nathanial almost always errs on the side of hype.","rating":4,"reviewerName":"ecksley","moreAction":null,"$kind":"Review"}],"mergeWhenFetched":false}]